@startuml AUTH-SEQ-03a-success
' Sơ đồ 3a: Sequence đăng nhập thành công (AS-IS)
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam SequenceArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceArrowFontName "Arial"
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2471A3
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 13
skinparam ParticipantFontName "Arial"
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FDEBD0
skinparam ActorBorderColor #B7770D
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D4AC0D
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #AAB7B8

title AUTH-SEQ-03a -- Dang nhap Thanh Cong (AS-IS)

actor Người_dùng as User
participant Frontend as FE
participant "API\n/auth/login" as API

User -> FE : email@ictu.edu.vn\n+ mật khẩu
FE -> FE : Validate miền @ictu.edu.vn
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/login
note right of API
  1. Tìm user theo email
  2. Argon2id verify
  3. Kiểm tra is_active
  4. Tạo JWT (HS256)
  auth.py:51-121
end note
API --> FE : 200 OK + Cookie\n{id, email, role}
FE --> User : /home\n"Đăng nhập thành công"

@enduml
